# =========================
# Data
# =========================
# (redundant with data/** above — kept as an explicit root-anchored glob so
# the .dvc negation below is unambiguous)
data/**
# DVC pointer files must stay tracked even though the real data under
# data/ is ignored above — they're small metadata, not the actual corpus.
# Must unignore directories first (data/**/) — git won't descend into an
# already-ignored dir to apply a deeper negation like data/statutes/*.dvc.
!data/**/
!data/**/*.dvc

# =========================
# MLflow / ingestion pipeline outputs
# =========================
NLPv2/ingestion/outputs/
